  = note: eventless, conditionless transitions are taken immediately in the same macrostep; a cycle of them never reaches a stable configuration (a warning: SCXML 1.0 Appendix D says a macrostep that does not terminate "is currently allowed", so the document is conforming and compiles, and a host bounds the run)
